ame fascia heights", "unit": "m", "method": "Back-projection of the right-hand fascia top/bottom edges (LSD, f200/215/230) at the assumed fascia heights", "confidence": 0.35}, {"name": "spot_beam", "value": "near-vertical beam above CL: centreline x~640 at the top row @f303 (565 @f230); width 0.27 m at z~5.4 and 0.39 m at z~4.7 => cone half-angle ~5 deg, apex ~7 m; modelled as a spot at (0.22,0.53,7.0) aimed at the origin, 11 deg", "unit": "m / deg", "method": "Min-channel intensity profiles across the beam at several rows, compared with projections of candidate beam axes", "confidence": 0.4}, {"name": "rack_focus_shot2", "value": "DS sharp f149-176 (bow Laplacian variance ~300 -> 55 by f189); background sharp from f197-201 (variance 35 -> 100+); f/2.8 at 36 mm gives ~41 px background blur at 0.6 m focus, matching the 45-60 px bokeh at f150", "unit": "frames", "method": "Laplacian variance in the DS bow window vs a background strip", "confidence": 0.8}, {"name": "crowd_extent_seen_in_shot2", "value": "pit crowd from Y~-4.7 (heads at the bottom edge of f303) to Y~5.5-6, X~-7..+5; back-row heads ~30 px at y~590@f303 (~12-13 m from the camera); a few cocktail tables inside the crowd on the right (lamp at ~(3.0,3.9))", "unit": "m", "method": "Back-projection of frame edges and head rows (z=1.6) with the solved camera; head widths measured on 4x zoom tiles", "confidence": 0.5}, {"name": "CL_face_box_scale_check", "value": "anime-face box 54+-2 px vs 37 px predicted for a 0.17 m box at the solved 8.9 m distance", "unit": "px", "method": "per_frame_cv anime_faces_xywh compared with the projection. Detector boxes are inflated at this small size, so they were not used for scale.", "confidence": 0.6}], "anchor_checks": [{"what": "shot2_CL_head_blob: CL point (0.12,0.41,1.50)", "f": 191, "expected_px": [455, 1066], "projected_px": [436, 1058.6], "err_px": 20.4}, {"what": "shot2_CL_head_blob: CL point (0.12,0.41,1.50)", "f": 199, "expected_px": [488, 1061], "projected_px": [471