px": 1.6}, {"what": "DS right hair bow (-0.502,-6.692,5.344) vs template track", "f": 200, "expected_px": [433, 523], "projected_px": [432.9, 526], "err_px": 3}, {"what": "DS right hair bow (-0.502,-6.692,5.344) vs template track", "f": 230, "expected_px": [240, 497], "projected_px": [240.4, 496.2], "err_px": 0.9}, {"what": "DS right hair bow (-0.502,-6.692,5.344) vs template track (bow at frame edge)", "f": 258, "expected_px": [88, 465], "projected_px": [76.3, 481], "err_px": 19.8}, {"what": "spot beam centreline at image row y=10", "f": 230, "expected_px": [565, 10], "projected_px": [570.3, 10], "err_px": 5.3}, {"what": "spot beam centreline at image row y=10", "f": 303, "expected_px": [640, 10], "projected_px": [646.4, 10], "err_px": 6.4}, {"what": "far mezz fascia top edge z=4.45 (Y=12) at image x=650", "f": 230, "expected_px": [650, 182], "projected_px": [650, 189.5], "err_px": 7.5}, {"what": "far mezz fascia bottom edge z=3.65 (Y=12) at image x=650", "f": 230, "expected_px": [650, 274], "projected_px": [650, 278.9], "err_px": 4.9}, {"what": "far mezz fascia top edge z=4.45 (Y=12) at image x=650", "f": 275, "expected_px": [650, 115], "projected_px": [650, 115.3], "err_px": 0.3}, {"what": "far mezz fascia bottom edge z=3.65 (Y=12) at image x=650", "f": 275, "expected_px": [650, 209], "projected_px": [650, 206.9], "err_px": 2.1}, {"what": "far mezz fascia top edge z=4.45 (Y=12) at image x=650", "f": 303, "expected_px": [650, 78], "projected_px": [650, 75.3], "err_px": 2.7}, {"what": "far mezz fascia bottom edge z=3.65 (Y=12) at image x=650", "f": 303, "expected_px": [650, 172], "projected_px": [650, 168], "err_px": 4}, {"what": "stage disc r=0.8 leftmost point (lit-pool edge, aligned p85 composite)", "f": 303, "expected_px": [452, 1230], "projected_px": [443.8, 1244.2], "err_px": 16.5}, {"what": "stage disc r=0.8 rightmost point", "f": 303, "expected_px": [762, 1260], "projected_px": [775.1, 1244.8], "err_px": 20.1}, {"what": "stage disc r=0.8 nearest (bottom) point", "f": 303, "expected_px": [612, 1332], "projected_px": [611, 1343.8], "err_px": 11.9}], "open_issues": ["CL is NOT at the stage centre in shot 2. Projecting (0,0,1.50) misses the head-blob track by 51 px mean (about 45 px too low and too far left); with CL's feet at (0.15,0.55) and her 1.5 m head point at (0.12,0.41) the mean error is 6.4 px for f203-300. The f191/f199 anchors (20/17 px) are partly hidden behind DS's shoulder frills, so their centroids are biased. Shots 1 and 3 should either use the same CL xy or accept the cut cheat.", "measured.json camera zoom/roll/pan for shot 2 (x1.146, +12 deg, -391 px) must not be used to drive the camera: it tracks DS's hair (f149-195) and the moving crowd. True background change is x1.03, +3.45 deg and (+431,-167) px. The camera move is a pan left of 16 deg plus a tilt down of 5 deg, with only ~0.6 m of body translation.", "Translation vs rotation is only weakly separable. Lamps and CL are equally well explained by a pure rotation from a fixed position. The 0.46/0.34/0.17 m arc exists only to make a static DS's hair bow track; if DS's MMD model turns or leans her head instead, a smaller arc (0-0.25 m) works just as well for the background.", "Depth inconsistency in the AI image: free lamp parallax puts the table lamps at 8-13 m (as near as CL), while crowd head sizes and the mezzanine edges put the tiers at 13-25 m. With a coherent tier layout the defocused frames f149-200 drift ~15-25 px and f200-250 ~6-15 px on lamps; f250-303 stays under ~7 px.", "Lamp and table sizes read 'too big' for their distance: about 30 px wide and ~115 px for one table at f303. Lamps of ~0.25-0.3 m and tables of ~1.0 m may be needed to match the look at the tier distances.", "The far-mezzanine distance trades against its fascia height. Y~12 with a 0.8 m fascia and floor at 4.45 is one solution; floor 4.0 with a 1.1 m fascia at Y~19 also fits the edges. The DS balcony floor (4.0) and the far mezzanine floor (4.45) were left at different levels.", "DS's handrail runs diagonally (heading -28.8 deg) and only ~0.45 m in front of the camera. Its apparent tube thickness (~50-60 px, blurred) suggests it is farther away or thinner. The balcony edge shape (diagonal/curved) must be reconciled with shot 1, where DS faces the camera over the same rail.", "Roll in f149-190 is constrained only by a few bokeh lamps at the right frame edge, so it is uncertain to about +-2 deg there. An alternative per-frame fit with a different lamp-depth model drifted to +4..9 deg; it was rejected as degenerate.", "Lens 36 mm is the best estimate; 32-40 mm is possible. Camera height scales with the assumed crowd height of 1.65 m (+-0.3 m).", "Keys are given for every frame f149-303, with duplicates (f%5==2) repeating f-1. If the builder thins them, keep Bezier interpolation and re-check the head-blob anchors.", "The dof.focus_keys entry is an extension to the schema. A builder that supports only a single focus point should focus on CL (0.12,0.41,1.40); the DS-sharp opening (f149-176) is then lost.", "The S2_* geometry, the spot light and the materials are view-derived suggestions with an S2_ prefix, so they can be merged or deduplicated against the main set layout. They are not a complete venue: no ceiling, walls, skyline, crowd or table clusters."]}